[+0.636,+0.705]; partial rho=+0.560 CI[+0.496,+0.616]. F1a=CONFIRMED F1b=CONFIRMED."], "auto_failure_mechanism": "D_positive (no failure: positive result)"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:low_measurement_reliability"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:MEASURE_RELIABILITY"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF20", "label": "Study family SF20: Absence validation (structure moves under real absence; simulation tracks it)", "score": 0.598, "reached_via": ["request matches RQC:RQC-016 (0.79); FAM:SF20 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-016", "request matches DS:Player_absence_spells (0.78); FAM:SF20 auto_uses_dataset DS:Player_absence_spells"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Absence validation (structure moves under real absence; simulation tracks it)", "auto_outcome_status": "untestable", "observed_hypothesis": "Real player absences move the association structure (V1) and the LOO simulation predicts the magnitude (V2).", "observed_result": ["[APPA-006] Gate G2 21/23 (91%) above null median; V1(a) 16/23 above own-null p95, binomial p=2.67e-16; V1(b) mean(D_real - median_null)=+0.142, CI [+0.103, +0.187].", "[APPA-007] Gate G3 Spearman +0.099. V2a Spearman +0.288, p=0.077, CI [-0.244, +0.667] FAIL; V2b partial +0.253, p=0.115, CI [-0.262, +0.615] FAIL. Diagnostics: H_code ruled out (rho=0.933); dropping 2 absorption cases rh [cut; read_family for the full text]", "[PAP-023] V1(a) 16/23 above p95 binomial p=2.67e-16; V1(b) +0.142 CI[+0.103,+0.187] CONFIRMED; V2a rho=+0.288 p=0.077 CI[-0.244,+0.667]; V2b rho=+0.253 p=0.115 NOT"]}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:small_sample"}]}], "n_results": 10}

